.subckt cml_vco_band_hr_gain_fast VCTRL KICKP KICKN VDD VSS CLK_P CLK_N
X0 N2P N2N N0P N0N VCTRL VDD VSS cml_vco_delay_hr_gain_fast
X1 N0P N0N N1P N1N VCTRL VDD VSS cml_vco_delay_hr_gain_fast
